# Keep the published archive lean.

# The README references screenshots via absolute raw.githubusercontent.com URLs,
# so they render on pub.dev without shipping the (large) image files. The one
# exception is simplest.gif, kept in the archive and declared in pubspec's
# `screenshots:` so pub.dev shows a thumbnail on the search card / package page.
# (Match contents with `screenshots/*`, not `screenshots/`, so the re-include
# below works — git can't re-include a file whose parent dir is fully excluded.)
screenshots/*
!screenshots/simplest.gif
implementasi_plan.md

# Build artifacts and tool caches (a .pubignore takes precedence over .gitignore,
# so these must be listed explicitly or they'd be bundled — e.g. example/build).
build/
.dart_tool/
